acing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Five miles per day.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/76/Five_miles_per_day..png/revision/latest?cb=20210321095245\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Five miles per day.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/76/Five_miles_per_day..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321095245\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/76/Five_miles_per_day..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321095245 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/76/Five_miles_per_day..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210321095245 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Five miles per day.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Five_miles_per_day..png\" data-image-name=\"Five miles per day..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\">Katy Wix</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Butter_in_the_microwave.\" title=\"Butter in the microwave.\">Butter in the microwave.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quisps.\" title=\"Quisps.\">Quisps.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Five miles per day.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">Series 9</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 18 September 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\">Katy Wix</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Five_miles_per_day.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Five miles per day\" was how fast <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> said <a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\">David Baddiel</a> was travelling during the <a href=\"/wiki/Build_the_most_robust_statue_of_the_most_delicate_thing\" title=\"Build the most robust statue of the most delicate thing\">Build the most robust statue of the most delicate thing</a> task. The hammer in the title card is likely a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Break_something_into_the_most_pieces_and_completely_fix_it\" title=\"Break something into the most pieces and completely fix it\">Break something into the most pieces and completely fix it</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Five_miles_per_day.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled '8 km/dag', which translates as '8 km/day'. Metric measurements of distance are standard in mainland Europe, so '8km/day' is more appropriate than 'five miles per day'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Viisi mailia päivässä', which translates as 'Five miles per day'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Åtte kilometer om dagen', which translates as 'Eight kilometres per day' (for the same reason as noted for the Danish title above). Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Five_miles_per_day.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">David Baddiel</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ed Gamble</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Brand\" title=\"Jo Brand\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jo Brand</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katy Wix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Matafeo\" title=\"Rose Matafeo\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rose Matafeo</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Weirdest_wooden_thing\" title=\"Weirdest wooden thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Weirdest wooden thing.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_all_the_things_that_were_hanging_from_the_wooden_board_in_the_lab\" title=\"List all the things that were hanging from the wooden board in the lab\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Go to the caravan. You must enter the caravan within 2 minutes of Alex entering the caravan.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>List all the things that were hanging from the wooden board in the lab. Also say the colour of the wooden board in the lab. Also say what Alex said to you in the lab.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Build_the_most_robust_statue_of_the_most_delicate_thing\" title=\"Build the most robust statue of the most delicate thing\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Build the most robust statue of the most delicate thing using the materials provided and place it on the red cross. Your delicate thing must be recognisable on the red cross an hour after you finish and should leave you feeling enormously proud of your creation.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Score a goal with this football.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Break_something_into_the_most_parts_and_completely_fix_it\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Break something into the most parts and completely fix it\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Break something into the most pieces and completely fix it.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fill_a_pint_glass_with_water\" title=\"Fill a pint glass with water\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Wearing your blindfold correctly at all times, fill a pint glass with water. If you make a big mess, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">23\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Five_miles_per_day.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/five-miles-day\"><i>Five miles per day.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/71678-003\"><i>Five miles per day.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141500\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.132 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 588/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25679/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 138/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800098/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   69.505      1 -total\n 50.28%   34.950      1 Template:Spoilers\n 48.36%   33.610      1 Template:MessageBox\n 24.81%   17.245      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 18.81%   13.072      1 Template:Episodes\n 11.75%    8.166     10 Template:Link\n  3.66%    2.542      5 Template:Color\n  2.91%    2.023      1 Template:Chronology\n  1.90%    1.319      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:786-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920141500 and revision id 42603. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}}}